   "Ba'athism": {
-    "d": "Arab nationalism and socialism under one vanguard party, summed up as unity, freedom and socialism. It is pan-nationalist: the Arab nation is one people whose states belong in a single Arab state. In a partocracy, a single ruling party guides the state and society as leader of the national resurrection. Economically it favors state socialism, with land reform and public ownership of key industries, and rejects laissez-faire. It is secular and modernizing, and defines freedom first as national liberation from foreign domination.",
